1
00:00:00,680 --> 00:00:03,530
(Sheldon:)the phone companies
have been lying to me.

2
00:00:05,830 --> 00:00:08,140
(Sheldon:)Penny.

3
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:10,550
Penny. Penny.

4
00:00:11,590 --> 00:00:14,390
(Penny:)You do realize I stand
on the other side of the door

5
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:17,180
(Penny:)waiting for you to finish
knocking three times.

6
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:20,510
(Sheldon:)I know. I can see the shadow
of your feet under the door.

7
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:23,470
(Penny:)Yeah, my point is
it's a waste of time.

8
00:00:23,470 --> 00:00:24,720
(Sheldon:)If you're looking for an example

9
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:26,820
(Sheldon:)of a waste of time,
I would refer you

10
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:28,740
(Sheldon:)to the conversation
we're having right now.

11
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:30,320
(Penny:)What do you want?

12
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:32,530
(Sheldon:)I've decided to take your advice
and have arranged

13
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:34,830
(Sheldon:)to go on a date
with Amy Farrah Fowler.

14
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:35,730
(Penny:)Oh, that's great.

15
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:37,030
(Penny:)Have fun.
Wait.

16
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:38,580
(Sheldon:)You have to drive me.

17
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:41,030
(Penny:)What?
You know I don't drive.

18
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:42,540
(Penny:)Well, go ask Leonard.
I did.

19
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:45,140
(Sheldon:)He said-- and I quote--
"Ask Penny.

20
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:47,720
It was her cockamamy idea."

21
00:00:47,730 --> 00:00:49,710
Leonard said "cockamamy"?

22
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:50,910
(Sheldon:)Actually, I'm paraphrasing.

23
00:00:50,910 --> 00:00:53,410
(Sheldon:)Having been raised
in a Christian household,

24
00:00:53,410 --> 00:00:56,430
(Sheldon:)I'm uncomfortable
with the language he used.

25
00:00:56,430 --> 00:00:57,730
(Sheldon:)And to be honest,

26
00:00:57,740 --> 00:01:00,220
(Sheldon:)I'm not entirely comfortable
with "cockamamy."

